# Build output. `snapshot/compiled/` is the inspection domain's COMPILED PROJECTION — derived from
# registry/ + transport/ by the compiler, and regenerated by every build. Tracking it dirties the
# repo on each rebuild (and fails the release preflight), and ships a derivation as if it were
# source. Every other domain repo ignores it; this one did not, because its .gitignore predates
# the domain.
compiled/
**/compiled/
snapshot/
